    "topic": "Moment of inertia of an annular disk",
    "statement": "A thin, uniform annular disk (a flat ring) has a total mass M, an outer radius R_out, and a concentric inner hole of radius R_in. Determine the moment of inertia of the disk about an axis that passes through its center and is perpendicular to the plane of the disk.",
